    "id": "ctkg:v3e-canonical-18db1468a28a055ec76dc1e4",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于非单位反馈系统，计算系统误差 E(s) = R(s) - Y(s) = R(s) - T(s)R(s)，然后应用终值定理求得多项式参考输入下的稳态误差。系统型别由使稳态误差为非零常数的多项式阶数确定。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For a non-unity feedback system, compute the system error E(s) = R(s) - Y(s) = R(s) - T(s)R(s), then apply the Final Value Theorem to find the steady-state error for a polynomial reference input. The system type is determined by the degree of the polynomial for which the steady-state error is a nonzero constant.",
